## Import

Import an existing membership using the composite ID `<rbac_group_id>:<user_id>`:

```shell
terraform import anthropic_rbac_group_member.example rbac_group_01UvWxYzAbCdEfGhIjKlMn:user_01AbCdEfGhIjKlMnOpQrSt
```
